# The unstamped watermark dropped: an activation arms without reading past the
# unstamped appends its own appends reported, and its live advance passes a
# 10.2.0 silo's acknowledged write.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestUnstampedNotReported
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms without reading past the highest reported unstamped append
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance
BOUNDS: WithMixedVersion = TRUE, WithBatch = FALSE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
    /\ rp[a] >= MarkerClosedAt(a) - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rp[a] >= MarkerClosedAt(a) - 1
\* MUTATION: reported unstamped appends are not waited for.
--- END
